<title>INDIA: Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - September 2.</title>
<headline>Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - September 2.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day upto 0630 GMT and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index (at 0630 GMT) was 3547.43, 32.81 points or 0.93 percent higher than Friday's close.</p>
